{"id":"P068-1","subject":"P","unit":"P068","unitTitle":"2025 ① (1월~4월) · 25.01.18 한국수자원공사 (휴노)","set":1,"questions":[{"id":"P068-S1-Q01","number":1,"question":"25.01.18 한국수자원공사 (휴노) · 객관식 1번","searchText":" 01\n\n유량도표 중에서 유황곡선의 횡축과 종축이 의미하는 것은?\n\n                  - 횡축 -                      - 종축 -\n\n ①      수위          유량\n\n ②      일 수          유량\n\n ③      유량          수위\n\n ④      유량          일 수","source":{"collection":"2025p1","collectionLabel":"2025 ① (1월~4월)","examLabel":"25.01.18 한국수자원공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2025p1-e01-m01","number":1},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e01-m01-q.webp","width":678,"height":508},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e01-m01-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1506},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e01-m01-e2.webp","width":696,"height":738}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P068-S1-Q02","number":2,"question":"25.01.18 한국수자원공사 (휴노) · 객관식 2번","searchText":" 02\n\n다음의 카르노 사이클에서 단열팽창 구간은?\n\n\n\n\n\n① 1 → 2        ② 2 → 3\n\n③ 3 → 4        ④ 4 → 1","source":{"collection":"2025p1","collectionLabel":"2025 ① (1월~4월)","examLabel":"25.01.18 한국수자원공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2025p1-e01-m02","number":2},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e01-m02-q.webp","width":678,"height":819},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e01-m02-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1146}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P068-S1-Q03","number":3,"question":"25.01.18 한국수자원공사 (휴노) · 객관식 3번","searchText":" 03\n\n단상 2선 방식에서 길이가 200km, 정전용량이 0.1\n\nFkm, 상전압이 40kV일 때, 1선의 충전전류A 는?\n\n(단, 상용주파수는 60Hz이다.)\n\n\n①          ② \n\n③          ④ ","source":{"collection":"2025p1","collectionLabel":"2025 ① (1월~4월)","examLabel":"25.01.18 한국수자원공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2025p1-e01-m03","number":3},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e01-m03-q.webp","width":678,"height":509},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e01-m03-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1020}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P068-S1-Q04","number":4,"question":"25.01.18 한국수자원공사 (휴노) · 객관식 4번","searchText":" 04\n\n단락비가 큰 동기발전기와 단락비가 작은 동기발전기를\n\n비교할 때, 단락비가 작은 기기의 특징은?\n\n\n① 단락전류가 크다.   ② 전압변동률이 크다.\n\n③ 충전전류가 크다.   ④ 전기자반작용이 작다.","source":{"collection":"2025p1","collectionLabel":"2025 ① (1월~4월)","examLabel":"25.01.18 한국수자원공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2025p1-e01-m04","number":4},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e01-m04-q.webp","width":696,"height":603},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e01-m04-e1.webp","width":678,"height":862}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P068-S1-Q05","number":5,"question":"25.01.18 한국수자원공사 (휴노) · 객관식 5번","searchText":" 05\n\n통신선과 전력선이 근접하여 접근할 때 발생하는 현상으로\n\n선로에 통신선 접근 시 통신선과 전력선 사이, 통신선과 대\n\n지간의 정전용량에 의해 통신선에 전압이 유기되는 현상을\n\n무엇이라 하는가?\n\n\n① 정전 유도장해     ② 고조파 유도장해\n\n③ 전력 유도장해     ④ 전자 유도장해","source":{"collection":"2025p1","collectionLabel":"2025 ① (1월~4월)","examLabel":"25.01.18 한국수자원공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2025p1-e01-m05","number":5},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e01-m05-q.webp","width":696,"height":723},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e01-m05-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P068-S1-Q06","number":6,"question":"25.01.18 한국수자원공사 (휴노) · 객관식 6번","searchText":" 06\n\nSPD(Surge Protective Device)를 시험에 의해 분류할 경우,\n\n클래스 3등급 시험의 전압파형크기(파두장/파미장)s로\n\n옳은 것은?\n\n\n① 250/2500      ② 10/350\n\n③ 8/20         ④ 1.2/50","source":{"collection":"2025p1","collectionLabel":"2025 ① (1월~4월)","examLabel":"25.01.18 한국수자원공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2025p1-e01-m06","number":6},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e01-m06-q.webp","width":696,"height":510},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e01-m06-e1.webp","width":678,"height":926}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P068-S1-Q07","number":7,"question":"25.01.18 한국수자원공사 (휴노) · 객관식 7번","searchText":" 07\n\n다음과 같은 조건의 부하에 700kVar 콘덴서를 설치할\n\n경우, 역률은 얼마인가?\n\n  ⦁피상전력 2000kVA   ⦁역률 0.6(지상)\n\n\n\n① 0.8          ② 0.85\n\n③ 0.92         ④ 0.96","source":{"collection":"2025p1","collectionLabel":"2025 ① (1월~4월)","examLabel":"25.01.18 한국수자원공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2025p1-e01-m07","number":7},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e01-m07-q.webp","width":678,"height":685},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e01-m07-e1.webp","width":678,"height":956}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P068-S1-Q08","number":8,"question":"25.01.18 한국수자원공사 (휴노) · 객관식 8번","searchText":" 08\n\n정정된 값 이상의 전류가 흐를 때 전류값이 클수록 동작\n\n시간이 짧아지고, 반대로 전류값이 적으면 동작시간이\n\n길어지는 특성을 지닌 계전기는?\n\n\n① 반한시 계전기     ② 정한시 계전기\n\n③ 순한시 계전기     ④ 비례한시 계전기","source":{"collection":"2025p1","collectionLabel":"2025 ① (1월~4월)","examLabel":"25.01.18 한국수자원공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2025p1-e01-m08","number":8},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e01-m08-q.webp","width":678,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e01-m08-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P068-S1-Q09","number":9,"question":"25.01.18 한국수자원공사 (휴노) · 객관식 9번","searchText":" 09\n\n극수가 4일 때, 전기각 90°에 해당하는 기하각은?\n\n\n① 22.5         ② 45\n\n③ 67.5         ④ 80","source":{"collection":"2025p1","collectionLabel":"2025 ① (1월~4월)","examLabel":"25.01.18 한국수자원공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2025p1-e01-m09","number":9},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e01-m09-q.webp","width":678,"height":555},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e01-m09-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P068-S1-Q10","number":10,"question":"25.01.18 한국수자원공사 (휴노) · 객관식 10번","searchText":" 10\n\n1800rpm으로 운전하는 4극 동기발전기가 있다.\n\n극당 자속수가 0.05, 권수가 100, 권선계수가 1.0일\n\n때, 발전기의 유기기전력 실횻값V은?\n\n①        ② \n③        ④ ","source":{"collection":"2025p1","collectionLabel":"2025 ① (1월~4월)","examLabel":"25.01.18 한국수자원공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2025p1-e01-m10","number":10},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e01-m10-q.webp","width":696,"height":689},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e01-m10-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P068-S1-Q11","number":11,"question":"25.01.18 한국수자원공사 (휴노) · 객관식 11번","searchText":" 11\n\n자기용량 4kVA 인 단권변압기의 1차 및 2차가\n\n3000/3600V일 때, 부하용량은 몇 kVA인가?\n\n\n① 64          ② 56\n\n③ 48          ④ 24","source":{"collection":"2025p1","collectionLabel":"2025 ① (1월~4월)","examLabel":"25.01.18 한국수자원공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2025p1-e01-m11","number":11},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e01-m11-q.webp","width":696,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e01-m11-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1278}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P068-S1-Q12","number":12,"question":"25.01.18 한국수자원공사 (휴노) · 객관식 12번","searchText":" 12\n\n단상 변압기의 철손 2kW, 동손 10kW이다. 여기에\n접속된 부하가 정격전류를 기준으로 의 부하전류를 가질                                        \n때, 전손실kW은?\n\n\n① 3.5          ② 4.0\n\n③ 4.5          ④ 5.0","source":{"collection":"2025p1","collectionLabel":"2025 ① (1월~4월)","examLabel":"25.01.18 한국수자원공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2025p1-e